<para id="RM000002ZYX000X" category="C" type-id="303CD" name-id="603KT-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2416</dtccode>
<dtcname>Height control sensor malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYX000X_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000065W00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>For vehicles without the intelligent parking assist system, the headlight leveling computer assembly receives the vehicle height signal directly from the height control sensor assembly (rear). For vehicles with the intelligent parking assist system, the vehicle height signal from the height control sensor assembly (rear) is input to the headlight leveling computer assembly via the television camera controller.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2416</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Height control sensor malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Height control sensor power source malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Height Control Sensor Assembly (Rear)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle Wire Harness and Connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYX000X_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000065X00000">
