</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYX000X_07" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___000065Y00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>After replacing the headlight leveling computer assembly and height control sensor assembly (rear), initialization is necessary. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000030GL000X"/>)</ptxt>
